{"id":18047,"name":"Tallapoosa County","slug":"tallapoosa-county","state":"Alabama","code":"AL","program":null,"sourceUrl":"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-lien/tax-lien-states/alabama-tax-lien-sales-how-to-get-12-interest/tallapoosa-county/","lastUpdated":"2026-07-13T12:29:23","facts":{"taxSaleType":"Tax Lien Sale","typicalSaleDate":"Yearly in May","bidProcedure":"Bid Down","redemptionPeriod":"Three years from the date of the tax sale","interestRate":"12%","extra":[{"label":"Sale Contact","value":"Tallapoosa County Revenue Commissioner"},{"label":"Auction Site","value":"GovEase"},{"label":"County Website","value":"Tallapoosa County"}]},"bodyHtml":"\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed aligncenter is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"oSHExA49OZnIJCRWUYqPvkiXGQz2K5hbslfMNyeag8TFLru31D\"><iframe title=\"Optimize Your Earnings with a 12% Returns - Tallapoosa County - Alabama Tax Lien Investing\" width=\"1170\" height=\"658\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/EVbfxEge6g0?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></span> \n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Get Dustin Hahn’s Tax Lien and Deed FREE Mini-Course</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Optimize-Your-Earnings-with-12%-Returns---Tallapoosa-County,-Alabama-Tax-Lien-Investing\">Optimize Your Earnings with 12% Returns &#8211; Tallapoosa County, Alabama Tax Lien Investing</h2>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Hunting for a solid investment?</strong> Tallapoosa County, Alabama, offers a tax lien auction with a sweet 12% interest. It&#8217;s all online, making it easy for anyone to jump in.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"What-is-a-Tax-Lien-Auction?\">What is a Tax Lien Auction?</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>A tax lien auction is where properties with overdue taxes are auctioned off. Investors can buy these liens, and if the taxes remain unpaid, they might even end up owning the property. The auction is conducted online through <a href=\"http://www.govease.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">GovEase</mark></a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Steps-to-Start-Tax-Lien-Investing-in-Tallapoosa-County\">Steps to Start Tax Lien Investing in Tallapoosa County</h3>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"1\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Research Local Laws:</strong><br><br>Understanding the legal framework in your area is crucial. Each county has different rules and regulations for tax lien sales.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"2\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Visit the County Treasurer’s Website:</strong><br><br>Check out the <a href=\"https://www.tallapoosapropertytax.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Tallapoosa County Revenue Commissioner</mark></a> for all the details on tax sales and related information.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"3\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Check the Auction Site:</strong><br><br>The tax lien auction for Tallapoosa County is held online at <a href=\"http://www.govease.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">GovEase</mark></a>.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"4\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Read the Details About Tax Liens:</strong><br><br>Make sure to understand the sale schedule, parcel inquiry, and other essential details. This PDF provides comprehensive information about the auction process.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"5\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Contact the County Office:</strong><br><br>For any additional inquiries, contacting the county office can provide clarity on specific questions.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Important-Details-for-Tallapoosa-County-Tax-Lien-Auction\">Important Details for Tallapoosa County Tax Lien Auction</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Tallapoosa-County-Courthouse-Alabama.webp 1081w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Tallapoosa-County-Courthouse-Alabama-541x360.webp 541w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Tallapoosa-County-Courthouse-Alabama-296x197.webp 296w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Tallapoosa-County-Courthouse-Alabama-768x512.webp 768w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Tallapoosa-County-Courthouse-Alabama-20x13.webp 20w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Tallapoosa-County-Courthouse-Alabama-32x21.webp 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Tallapoosa-County-Courthouse-Alabama.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1081\" srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Tallapoosa-County-Courthouse-Alabama.png 1081w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Tallapoosa-County-Courthouse-Alabama-541x360.png 541w, https://va